      {
        "uuid": "msg-4",
        "text": "For real-time delivery the architecture choice is separate from CRUD versus event sourcing. You want a pub-sub layer. The simplest path is Postgres LISTEN/NOTIFY or a Redis pub-sub channel that your API server subscribes to. Both approaches integrate well with WebSockets.",
        "content": [
